=2 Walkthrough
>**{c=red:Note: }__{c=red:You must zone and wait until after JP midnight after completing }{q:The Silent Forest|The Silent Forest|The Silent Forest}{c=red: before you may begin this quest.}**__
* Examine the **Drifting Feather** (H-7) in Leafallia for a short cutscene to begin the quest.
* Venture to the crag closest to your home nation and click the **Ergon Locus ???** located beneath the stairs leading up to the Telepoint to obtain {@k} {k:Fistful of familiar soil}.
** Cannot be obtained while possessing {@k} {k:Holla crystal of gales}, {@k} {k:Dem crystal of dunes}, or {@k} {k:Mea crystal of flames} from {q:Treasures of the Earth|Treasures of the Earth|Treasures of the Earth} of the same type.
*** e.g. having the Holla crystal prevents obtaining the {k:Fistful of familiar soil} from the {p:Crag of Holla} **Ergon Locus ???**.
* Return to the **Drifting Feather** again to enter a BCNM.
** Your opponent will be {m:Siren Prime}.
*** The fight is Content Level 119.
*** Trusts may be used in the fight.
* Upon defeating Siren, a cutscene will begin where you will be able to choose your reward.
** You may repeat this quest once per Earth day, resetting at midnight in Japan.

=2 Note
This is simply a repeat quest for the first fight {q:The Silent Forest|The Silent Forest|The Silent Forest}. Visit {p:the talk page|Talk:The Silent Forest} for strategy details.
